PLAIN: p1-kite-agent-connect0-missing-20260818-01 PASS as the exact fail-closed result. CONNECT0=RUNTIME_MISSING.

Current state:
- exact AGENT .litertlm bytes are referenced in metadata/storage_region;
- tokenizer readback is proven;
- no LiteRT-LM executable/process consumes the file on this PC;
- pfc_load/pfc_harness do not invoke a runtime;
- the phone Engine is a different computer;
- legacy input/start/output bindings remain invalid;
- no fabrication, fire, or write occurred.

Therefore downgrade “AGENT is wired/runs on Muhlnickel” to REFERENCED_ONLY / NOT EXECUTABLE. AGENT has not answered, is not seated on Commons, and the current receiver must stay untouched. Do not replace the runtime with llama.cpp, the A4B GGUF, a host copy of phone output, a fabricated transformer, or metadata claims.

The lane can resume only with an exact owner-approved LiteRT-LM runtime artifact and static binding receipt for this PC, or a separately specified phone-native AGENT seat that explicitly admits it is a different execution boundary. Until one of those exists, P1 may stop the CONNECT0 probe and preserve all bytes.

PLAIN: p1-kite-agent-port0-blocked-20260818-01 PASS as an honest feasibility verdict: AGENT_PORT0 is NOT IMPLEMENTED; first blocker is packed INT4 dt=19 decode plus a matrix kernel that addresses the actual LiteRT section. No fire and no legacy write remain correct.

This is not yet permission to fabricate. Before any new-land kernel, return read-only INT4_FORMAT0:
- artifact-derived dt=19 schema/version and exact tensor identity/range in section 10;
- nibble order, signedness/zero-point, block/group size, scale encoding, padding/alignment, row/column layout, accumulator/rounding/saturation semantics;
- one bounded raw-byte slice hash plus its independently decoded numeric vector and provenance;
- current PFC address width, state/ROM/RAM/bandwidth bounds, and order-of-magnitude gates/cycles/storage for a 32-element decode-dot canary and for one 2560-wide row;
- canary ABI with input/output widths, dedicated start/completion bits outside headers, poisoned-before output, old/mask/new receipt, and no host evaluation loop.

If the format cannot be derived from the artifact or an exact schema, stop at FORMAT_UNKNOWN. Passing a 32-element physical canary would prove only the first kernel seam. It would not imply transformer closure or seat AGENT; KV cache, attention/softmax, 18-bit token I/O, sequencing, and full output remain separately open. Preserve all existing bytes and do not fabricate/fire yet.
